- **1Password reads** — all agents must read existing `BMH Secrets` items through the service account only: `export OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -w -s OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN)` then `op read "<redacted-1password-ref>"`. Do not use desktop-app/GUI/biometric/browser authorization for reads. If a GUI authorization prompt appears during a read, stop that path and retry with the service account; do not ask Jarrad to approve a read.
